                                                                                                                         a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>]) ; 
                                                                         a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>].
lslife:WCSResponse <http://semanticscience.org/resource/comment> "A response obtained from a WCS server, including the response manifestation, the experiment specification URL, layer units and type code.";
                   a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
